fundamental principles of criminal behavior.

345
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:16,540
All investigative indicators pointed
toward a disturbing working hypothesis:

346
00:20:16,540 --> 00:20:21,160
The robbery was a theatrical diversion
orchestrated by an inside accomplice.

347
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,801
[HOST] While Jennifer
continued to deliver her

348
00:20:24,801 --> 00:20:26,792
