on parenting philosophies.

446
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:10,748
Parental love truly serves as an
empowering foundation only when grounded in

447
00:26:10,748 --> 00:26:15,220
respect for the child's individual humanity
and acceptance of their limitations.

448
00:26:15,970 --> 00:26:19,254
When parents transform their
offspring into instruments

449
00:26:19,254 --> 00:26:21,940
