dialogue has been firmly bolted shut.

455
00:26:41,980 --> 00:26:43,218
Empathy, forgiveness,

456
00:26:43,218 --> 00:26:46,284
and active listening
constitute the only true shield

457
00:26:46,284 --> 00:26:49,940
safeguarding young minds against
perilous psychological traps.

458
00:26:50,690 --> 00:26:54,950
A true home must serve as the safest
refuge to return to when one stumbles,

459
00:26:54,950 --> 00:26:58,130
