492
00:28:44,420 --> 00:28:45,758
Red Flag Number Four:

493
00:28:45,758 --> 00:28:49,900
Emotional estrangement and toxic
domestic silence under one roof.

494
00:28:50,550 --> 00:28:53,456
When family members share
